{"title":"TikTok is back in app stores","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores","date":1739557200000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you ignore your Valentine’s Day date.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/99982811-2b8d-422f-a413-91e9678a7a6c/GettyImages-2198390977.jpg?t=1739552808\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by JIM WATSON/AFP via Getty Images</p></span></div></div><p>This week, multiple <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/usaid-trump-musk-shutdown-doge-foreign-aid-9e5e2f1bceac5d9730dd161b59307488?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">judges</a> <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-asks-us-court-end-judicial-overreach-allow-funding-freezes-2025-02-11/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">blocked</a> the most egregious shutdowns by President Elon Musk’s Department Of Government Efficiency (DOGE). However Musk and DOGE decide to react, you <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/doge-website-is-just-one-big-x-ad/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">won’t see it</a> on their website, especially since the databases it uses <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/anyone-can-push-updates-to-the-doge-gov-website-2/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">are unsecured</a>. The US government is so powerful, dude, they’re getting <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/610902/bing-jumps-on-the-gulf-of-america-bandwagon?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">so many map services</a> to change the Gulf of Mexico’s name… meanwhile, <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/tiktok-ban-back-in-ios-app-store-google-play-store/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores#intcid=recommendations_popular-right-rail_8a80f833-82c5-4531-9bc1-5a66cd99dd37_popular4-1_fallback_cral-top2-2\" target=\"_blank\">TikTok is back</a> in app stores. And President Trump has become <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/02/11/us/politics/trump-musk.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">office decor</a> for Musk. Sad! Musk’s other power move this week was offering to <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/02/10/elon-musk-led-team-submits-97-4b-bid-for-openai/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">buy OpenAI</a>, in an effort to <a href=\"https://www.vox.com/future-perfect/399713/elon-musk-openai-chatgpt-sam-altman-takeover-nonprofit?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">complicate</a> the company’s switch from not-quite-profit to definitely-for-profit. So far, the main complication is a deeply embarrassing <a href=\"https://time.com/7216469/elon-musk-buy-openai-sam-altman/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter fight</a>.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3K4Fj6G7-6U&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">January 6th The Musical</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/fuckyeahchinesefashion/773389745891033088/cr-%E8%89%BE%E5%A7%A8%E8%94%AC%E5%A6%83%E5%A8%98%E5%A8%98%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Incredible things are happening on RedNote</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/zedogica/772721424516481024?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Good meme</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/lilnoodledragon.bsky.social/post/3lebasp2k5c2b?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">A busty dragoness</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DEOW7hbOH3m/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Lollipop finally got to leave the barn</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/BrittanytB/status/1890097790086443187?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">A new name for the Gulf of Mexico</a></p></li><li><p><i><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DF3P3rQtleC/?hl=en&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Love Island</a></i><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DF3P3rQtleC/?hl=en&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\"> with a toddler</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/thecryingbean/772871284419887104?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" target=\"_blank\">A good post</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/momsboyfri3nd/status/1890112716578386029?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=tiktok-is-back-in-app-stores\" tar